    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s03-t02-mother-02-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "母题精讲 · 第2题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s03-t02-mother-02",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（22江苏）某企业年终评选了30名优秀员工，分三个等级，分别按每人10万元、5万元、1万元给与奖励。若共发放奖金89万元，则获得1万元奖金的员工有：",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "14人"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "19人"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "20人"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "21人"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "B",
        "sourceAnswer": "B"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          33
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          27
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s03-t02-mother-02-p033.webp",
            "alt": "和差倍比问题（三） · 母题精讲2 · 讲义第27页",
            "pdfPage": 33
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s03-t02-mother-02-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s03-t02-mother-02",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：B"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先设三档获奖人数分别x、y、z。总人数30，总奖金89万元。用奖金式减去每人至少1万元的30万元，就能消掉z。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "x+y+z=30,\\quad10x+5y+z=89\\Rightarrow9x+4y=59"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "模4看，x≡3(mod4)。又9x≤59，故x只能3，得到y=(59-27)/4=8，z=30-3-8=19。核验30+40+19=89万元，所以选B。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "多档金额题先扣最低档，消去一个未知数，再用整除与范围筛解。"
        }
      ],
